Smart Trash Bot 

An autonomous waste collection robot designed to assist with waste management.

Components Used
Microcontroller :Arduino Uno -2
Sensors:Ultrasonic Sensor (HC-SR04), Moisture sensor, 
  GSM Module .
Actuators: Servo Motor (SG90) / DC Gear Motors
Motor Driver : L298N Motor Driver Module
Power Supply:*9V Battery / 18650 Li-ion Batteries
Chassis:Custom Robot Chassis / Trash Bin Setup
How it works:
Detect - Move - Collect - Detect waste - Segregate - Monitor Bin Level - Send GSM alert 
